          "items": [
            "Sleeping Arrangements <br>Two Story Home<br>1st Floor | Master, King<br>2nd Floor | Guest, King; Guest, Queen; Bonus Living, Queen Sleeper Sofa<br><br>Parking: This property offers two parking spots, providing easy and reliable access for guests throughout their stay.<br><br>Parking: This property offers two parking spots, providing easy and reliable access for guests throughout their stay.<br><br>A Hard Days Nap – Luxury Coastal Escape in WaterColor<br>Welcome to A Hard Days Nap, a professionally decorated, high-end coastal retreat located in the heart of WaterColor. This stunning single-family home offers the perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and convenience—ideal for families or couples seeking a relaxing beach vacation along Florida’s scenic 30A.<br><br>Bedrooms and Bathrooms<br>First Floor King Master Suite with a private en suite bathroom<br>Second Floor King Master Suite with en suite bath and a screened balcony featuring a cozy swing bed<br>Second Floor Queen Guest Bedroom with its own en suite bath<br>Two Half Baths – one on each floor for added convenience<br><br>Living Spaces and Features<br>Open-concept kitchen, living and dining area with elegant coastal décor<br>Wet bar and dedicated desk/workspace on the first floor<br>Screened front porch and side patio with built-in gas BBQ grill for outdoor entertaining<br>Private driveway for secure parking and garage with beach items and bikes<br>Second Floor Bonus Living Area with a pull-out sofa – perfect for kids or extra guests<br>Private Office near the upstairs living area for remote work or quiet reading<br>Golf cart rentals are available for an additional fee. There is a limited number of carts available, so be sure to reserve early! More information will be provided upon booking.<br><br>Prime Location<br>Just a short walk, bike ride, or golf cart cruise to:<br>Publix Grocery<br>Pizza by the Sea<br>Seagrove Village Market Café<br>The iconic town of Seaside<br><br>Watercolor Resort Amenities<br>Guests enjoy full access to all Watercolor amenities, including:<br>Resort-style pools<br>Tennis courts<br>Nature trails<br>The Watercolor Beach Club<br><br>Whether you're sipping coffee on the swing bed, grilling with family on the patio, or exploring the charm of Seaside, A Hard Days Nap offers the perfect setting for your next unforgettable coastal vacation.<br><br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet<br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use.",
